{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140059-make-a-plothook","id":1140059,"title":"Make a plothook","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-13T18:51:14-07:00","id":1140059,"title":"Make a plothook","content":"I came up with a new thread game and decided to try it on the C:TD forums. The rules are simple, I give you details on a setting and you have to make a plothook based in the setting.<br /> <br /> Winterberry, Rhode Island is a small costal township. It was founded in the 18th century as a crab fishing settlement. Over the years, the town has attracted Changelings due to the Glamour the town's location and urban legends generate.<br /> <br /> Start making plothooks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T14:05:16-07:00","id":1140306,"title":"","content":"I'm now playing Dishonored, so my proto-ideas on the depressive and lovecraftian side of the spectrum. Not sure, it's either creative or what you looking for.<br /> <br /> And there's not a lot to work with, yet.<br /> <br /> Could you keep giving out the trivia about location, until it clicks, you know? <br /> <br /> Once in a certain period of time. Something, that would give us preferred genre, tone, general feel of the place, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":5211,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","user":"Firkraag","date":". 09-14-2017, 05:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T16:35:22-07:00","id":1140349,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firkraag</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140059-make-a-plothook?p=1140306#post1140306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm now playing Dishonored, so my proto-ideas on the depressive and lovecraftian side of the spectrum. Not sure, it's either creative or what you looking for.<br /> <br /> And there's not a lot to work with, yet.<br /> <br /> Could you keep giving out the trivia about location, until it clicks, you know?<br /> <br /> Once in a certain period of time. Something, that would give us preferred genre, tone, general feel of the place, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good point. Winterberry's population is 10,000 people, 5% of them being Changelings. The town has a boardwalk that has been around since the 1790s and is kept under constant renovation. The main school in the town is Winterberry Academy, a prep school that is k-12. The town has a crime problem that is chiefly caused by two gangs, The 9th Avenue Skulls and the Overlords, who are currently in a feud. There is also a mafia lieutenant named Mario Satori, who runs a chop shop in the local scrapyard. The town also has a fair share of urban legends, the most infamous being a costal cave where a gangster buried his loot before fleeing the cops during the 20s.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T17:02:01-07:00","id":1140358,"title":"","content":"500 hundred Changelings? <br /> <br /> Where do they get THAT amount of Glamour - A Dream Generator?<br /> <br /> This town should be THE Changeling Capital of the World!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":5211,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","user":"Firkraag","date":". 09-14-2017, 08:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T17:49:37-07:00","id":1140365,"title":"","content":"A free hold becomes unveiled from a previously unknown trod, but all who journey into it's halls vanish<br /> <br /> the duke becomes very ill and the regent is paranoid about the shadow court<br /> <br /> A merfolk shows up on the shoreline but refuses (or is unable) to speak about why they have come<br /> <br /> a sleeping dragon is found under a noted freehold and it's keeper is unsure how to handle it<br /> <br /> A one of the most commonly used trods is beset by a terrible storm with unpleasant wails<br /> <br /> the motley feels the chrysalis of a changeling and goes to help them out but they arrive to find... nothing more than a potent dreamer<br /> <br /> a new changeling in town carries a noted artifact that gives her the right to rule the island, are they a fraud and more importantly who is the better leader<br /> <br /> a nightmare chimera has been kidnapping dreamer children, however multiple motleys have claimed to have destroyed it, are there multiple or can it bring itself back from the grave<br /> <br /> the selkies are outraged to find a selkie skin prominently displayed in the collection of a powerful noble and want help taking it back and finding its owner","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3729-darkfoxdev","name":"Darkfoxdev","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T18:36:04-07:00","id":1140383,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firkraag</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140059-make-a-plothook?p=1140358#post1140358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">500 hundred Changelings?<br /> <br /> Where do they get THAT amount of Glamour - A Dream Generator?<br /> <br /> This town should be THE Changeling Capital of the World!</div> </div> </div> </div>I should bring down the population of changelings to like %1 or lower. Also, with the street gangs, the most notable aspect of them is that the Overlords are led by by a Unseelie changeling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T02:54:12-07:00","id":1140465,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140059-make-a-plothook?p=1140383#post1140383\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Overlords are led by by a Unseelie changeling.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not just an Unseelie, but Unseelie Sidhe of House Ailil, robbed of a rightful place as a ruler of County of Wily Mists (Winterberry). Or so she likes to brag...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}